<title>USA: Advanced Magnetics signs distribution pact.</title>
<headline>Advanced Magnetics signs distribution pact.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Magnetics Inc said Tuesday it has signed an agreement with TaeJoon Pharmaceutical Co Ltd for the exclusive rights to distribute in South Korea its contrast agent for magnetic resonance imaging of liver lesions.</p>
<p>The contrast agent is called Feridex I.V.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed. It stipulates that TaeJoon Pharmaceutical has the responsibility to obtain South Korean government registration and permission to sell Feridex I.V.</p>
</text>
